  documentId: DOC_NEWS_1
  documentType: 0
  title: "K\xFCresel \u0131s\u0131nma, sofralar\u0131n gelece\u011Fini tehdit ediyor"
  body: "\u0130klim krizi yaln\u0131zca yaz aylar\u0131n\u0131n konusu de\u011Fil.
    De\u011Fi\u015Fen ya\u011F\u0131\u015Flar, kurakl\u0131k ve a\u015F\u0131r\u0131
    hava olaylar\u0131 d\xFCnya genelinde g\u0131da \xFCretimini etkiliyor. Kas\u0131m
    ay\u0131nda COP31'e haz\u0131rlanan Antalya'da sofran\u0131n yar\u0131n\u0131
    konu\u015Fuluyor.\n\nBug\xFCn masada et ve s\xFCt \xFCr\xFCnleri var. SKT, etiket
    ve g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCr bozulmay\u0131 inceleyin. At\u0131\u011F\u0131 kayna\u011F\u0131nda
    ay\u0131rmak, k\u0131y\u0131lar\u0131 ve caretta carettalar\u0131n ya\u015Fam
    alanlar\u0131n\u0131 korumaya da yard\u0131mc\u0131 olur."
  taskInstructionBox: "A\xC7ILAN GRUPLAR / ET VE S\xDCT \xDCR\xDCNLER\u0130"
  illustration: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 97a8e86583fc5294e8b7a7814b8c03d7, type: 3}
